Description: Converts digital polymerase chain reaction platform exports to
    the DDES exchange format. The package supports QIAcuity analysis,
    plate-layout, and relative-fluorescence exports and QX200 QuantaSoft head
    and amplitude exports. It writes the DDES main, assay, and intensity files.
